# Phase 5-E1D - LOCAL SimFin data. DO NOT COMMIT.
#
# research/run_phase5e1d_simfin_free_smoke_test.py --live writes SimFin payloads
# here:
#   raw/        verbatim provider JSON responses
#   normalized/ flattened probe CSVs derived from those responses
#
# Even free-tier SimFin data is kept out of git for data hygiene and to match the
# FMP convention. Only summarized coverage/schema/safety reports (counts, redacted
# URLs, file paths - never payloads or the API key) go to the committed artifacts
# under research/output/phase5e1d_simfin_free_smoke_test/.
raw/
normalized/

# Belt-and-braces: ignore everything in this directory EXCEPT this .gitignore,
# so no payload can ever be staged from here by accident.
*
!.gitignore
